<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell Computer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura Equity Research said it downgraded Dell Computer Corp to neutral from buy due to price.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/2 to 85-1/4.</p>
